      },
      "instruction": {
        "type": "static_text",
        "text": "In general, we are scheduling into May and June for most trips. Some cruises need to be booked even further in advance and may not be available until September of next year. When you call please have a calendar available and your certificate number. Would you like me to transfer you to the scheduling department?"
      }
    },
