      "type": "conversation",
      "display_position": {
        "x": 6600,
        "y": 3560
      },
      "instruction": {
        "type": "static_text",
        "text": "While I have you, I wanted to mention we have a special right now for the holidays. You can add on a Hawaii package to your current trip, so after this trip you can start planning your Hawaii trip. It includes round trip airfare for two people and a four night hotel stay for only $699 - that's not per person, that's total for the both of you. I can transfer you right now to a live agent who can provide more details. Can I transfer you?"
      }
    },
