      "instruction": {
        "type": "static_text",
        "text": "Before you go, I wanted to let you know about a special we have right now for the holidays. You can add on a Hawaii package - round trip airfare for two people and a four night hotel stay for only $699. That is not per person, that is total for the both of you. Would you like me to transfer you to someone who can give you more details?"
